WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.535
-Today is
Martin Luther King Day.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.737
Here to celebrate is one
of our writers.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.872
Please give it up
for Amber Ruffin, everyone.

00:00:06.872 --> 00:00:08.608
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.576
-♪ Get up and shout, Yay! ♪

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:13.146
♪ It's Martin Luther King Day ♪

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:15.014
♪ It's a day we look upon ♪

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.549
♪ With happiness and cheer ♪

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.550
♪ Get up and shout, Yay! ♪

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.887
♪ It's Martin Luther King Day ♪

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.989
♪ It's the day we remember ♪

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.258
♪ What he was fightin' for ♪

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.592
♪♪

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.694
♪ A bunch of laws were made ♪

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:30.997
♪ To keep Black people
oppressed ♪

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.065
♪ So Black people organized ♪

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.600
♪ To try to clean this mess ♪

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.136
♪ So MLK said, Hey, America? ♪

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:39.172
♪ We want civil rights ♪

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.973
♪ And they said, Mm, maybe ♪

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:42.708
♪ Just not as much as whites ♪

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.844
♪ A lot of white people
got upset ♪

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:47.013
♪ That we even dared to ask ♪

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.015
♪ And that's
the really crazy part ♪

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.883
So let's spend
some time there.

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.153
They hated Black people so bad,
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.521
they couldn't even sit next
to them on a bus!

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:57.656
And they didn't just go away.

00:00:57.656 --> 00:00:59.224
They're still alive and voting.

00:00:59.224 --> 00:01:01.628
Like people always look
at the civil rights movement

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:03.162
as like this little bit of time,

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:05.532
but it lasted for [bleep] ever!

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:06.733
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.935
And it's still kind of going on!

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.736
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:12.604
♪♪

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:13.772
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:15.708
♪ Get up and shout, Yay! ♪

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.544
♪ It's Martin Luther King Day ♪

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.213
♪ It's a day we look upon ♪

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.647
♪ With happiness and cheer ♪

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:23.582
♪ Get up and shout, Yay! ♪

00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:26.085
♪ It's Martin Luther King Day ♪

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:27.920
♪ If you love freedom ♪

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.223
♪ It's the best day
of the year ♪

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.658
[ Cheering ]
♪♪

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.159
♪ So MLK makes me go, Yay! ♪

00:01:34.159 --> 00:01:36.763
'Cause it's like dang!

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.198
[ Laughter ]
You know, we're always talking

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:41.901
about white supremacy and how
like it's a few idiots,

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.669
but it's a lotta people.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.772
It's what killed
Martin Luther King

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.941
and it's still around and that
[bleep] is infuriating!

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:51.211
Like calling out injustice
all the time

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.713
can really get a person down.
-Whoo!

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.515
Like you could literally
be pointing it out

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.217
all day, every day,
and you wouldn't get it all!

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:00.019
But it's like,
if you don't do it,

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:01.854
who else is gonna do it?

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.623
You feel like
this huge mountain,

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.224
it's this huge mountain

00:02:05.224 --> 00:02:07.260
you couldn't possibly
make a dent in.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.429
♪♪

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.697
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:14.467
But, you know, MLK was
always hopeful, so like...

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:17.236
[ Cheer ]

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:18.971
...I choose to be hopeful, too.

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:22.008
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.479
♪ Get up and shout, Yay! ♪
-♪ Yay! ♪

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:30.016
♪ It's Martin Luther King Day
Oh, yeah! ♪

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:31.918
♪ It's a day we understand ♪

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.519
♪ How great we all can be ♪

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:35.354
♪ Get up and shout ♪
-♪ Yay! ♪

00:02:35.354 --> 00:02:37.924
-♪ It's Martin Luther King Day ♪

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.759
♪ If you love freedom ♪

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:41.160
♪ It's the best day ♪

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.129
♪ Of the year! ♪

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:48.200
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.271
-Amber Ruffin, everybody!

